  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Planering av projekt inom offentlig upphandling i Ukraina. Denna planerigsinsats inneb&#xE4;r att Sipu International- tillsammans med upphandlingsenheten p&#xE5; det ukrainska ekoministeriet- skall planera (4dagar)det f&#xF6;rsta &#xE5;ret av en utbildningsinsats inom offentlig upphandling. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r en EU-anpassad lag f&#xF6;r offentlig upphandling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning trip to formulate a public procurement training programme in Ukraine. Two consultatnts from Sipu International will go to Kyiv for four days to make up a projct proposal. The overall aim is to develop a legislation on Public Procurement, which is compatible to EU standards.</narrative>
  </description>
